  "content": "Okāsa, ahaṃ Bhante, tisaraṇena saha aṭṭhaṅgasamannāgataṃ uposathasīlaṃ dhammaṃ  yācāmi.Anuggahaṃ katvā sīlaṃ detha me Bhante.Okāsa, dutiyampi ahaṃ Bhante, tisaraṇena saha aṭṭhaṅgasamannāgataṃ uposathasīlaṃ dhammaṃ yācāmi.Anuggahaṃ katvā sīlaṃ detha me Bhante.Okāsa, tatiyampi ahaṃ Bhante, tisaraṇena saha aṭṭhaṅgasamannāgataṃ uposathasīlaṃ dhammaṃ  yācāmi.Anuggahaṃ katvā sīlaṃ detha me Bhante.",
